  "name": "Hongjing HCM - Time-Based Sql Injection",
  "author": "s4e-io",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "description": "There is a SQL injection vulnerability in the /gz/LoadOtherTreeServlet interface of Hongjing HCM. Unauthenticated remote attackers can use the SQL injection vulnerability with the database xp_cmdshell to execute arbitrary commands and control the server. After analysis and judgment, the vulnerability is easy to exploit and it is recommended to be fixed as soon as possible.\n",
